  "description": "Five years as an idol trainee. I failed the audition program, then I return to school.\n\nAerobics? Please leave me alone! I want to live quietly now!\n\nThe aerobics club like that said they will grant my wish. The requirement is to enter the aerobics competition! And somehow, I had to aim for the championship. Can we, who are still awkward and newbies, do well?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=737032), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4635512)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0000801), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/drama/shutup-dance/list?title_no=3462)",
